{pad:meta title='A state diagram', about='The start and the end, labelled transitions, a choice and a line of description.'/}
{diagram:state title='A ticket'}
  [*] --> Open
  Open --> Working : take
  Working : the clock runs
  state Done <<choice>>
  Working --> Done : finish
  Done --> Closed : accepted
  Done --> Working : rejected
  Closed --> [*]
{/diagram:state}
